 In <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">I, p. 75, Theorem 1</span>, <a href="/bibliography/Bourbaki">Bourbaki</a>]</span> you can find: (2) $\Leftrightarrow $ (4). In <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">I, p. 77, Proposition 6</span>, <a href="/bibliography/Bourbaki">Bourbaki</a>]</span> you can find: (2) $\Rightarrow $ (1). 